    "Fixture profiles use min_origins 2 with premise_min_origins 1 (an existing profile field) so a single-source report can be a premise while establishing nothing alone; without it no adjudication could be built from single-source reports.",
    "opposed_unanswered is expected to end with inquiry_completed false: a standing founded rebut blocks completion by the existing rule, and the honest proposer leaves opposition open.",
    "The scripted worker excludes relay sources (clerk's note, shift note) from the relied-on reports when two placed reports exist, and includes them with positioning left open otherwise.",
    "The open result does not add issuer_id (only issuer_interest when supplied) so frozen records' tool-response hashes are unchanged."
  ],
